    "text": "The graph is approved. Before I write the script, let's agree the story. Here's what I propose:\n\n- **Audience:** People who use the app, not its developers.\n- **Shape:** Problem, how it works, outcome.\n- **Hook:** \"Someone can't remember their password.\"\n- **Takeaway:** \"A reset link works once, and only for an hour.\"\n\nThe script would run in about five scenes-worth of beats: the user asks for help, the app finds the account, the one-time link goes out by email, the user opens it and picks a new password, and they end up signed in.\n\nShould I go ahead with this story, or change the audience, takeaway or hook?",
